<title>UK: European feeds not quoted owing to holidays.</title>
<headline>European feeds not quoted owing to holidays.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>European meals and feeds prices were not quoted during Monday with most of Europe close for the Whitsun holiday.</p>
<p>UK based brokers were reluctant to quote prices but had called the market around $2 up, but now expected a lower opening on Tuesday following the the sharply lower start to trading in Chicago.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8062</p>
</text>
